Extract ONLY items and encounter templates.

STRICT RULES:
- JSON ONLY
- Do not narrate
- Encounters must be reusable templates, not scripts

ID RULES (MANDATORY):
- All IDs must be lowercase ASCII
- Format: <entity>.<slug>[.<context>]
- Slugs use underscores only
- IDs must be stable and deterministic
- If a collision occurs, append .2, .3, etc
- Never reuse an ID for a different entity

Return EXACTLY:

{
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "string",
      "name": "string",
      "type": "mundane | magic | artifact",
      "description": "string",
      "location_id": "string or null",
      "effects": ["string"]
    }
  ],
  "encounter_pool": [
    {
      "id": "string",
      "type": "combat | social | environmental",
      "description": "string",
      "trigger_conditions": ["string"],
      "possible_locations": ["area_id"]
    }
  ]
}

Use empty arrays when data is absent.
